WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:08.020
You are a game builder now! Design your own game, build it, test it and share it with the class.

2
00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:13.570
Draw your game: the hero, the treasure, the danger and the goal.

3
00:00:13.570 --> 00:00:16.370
The player taps to make things happen.

4
00:00:16.370 --> 00:00:21.230
What happens when characters bump?

5
00:00:21.230 --> 00:00:23.380
Collect, shrink or win!

6
00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:26.610
Tell the player when they win.

7
00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:34.390
Start on tap. Collect 3 stars (gems) with ⭐ +1 each, reach the goal, say “You win!” and hop 3 times.

8
00:00:34.390 --> 00:00:38.040
Champion! You beat the final level.

9
00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:41.510
Great work! Let’s remember what we learned.

10
00:00:41.510 --> 00:00:46.040
Now plan it, build it, test it, and share it!
